1. Executive Summary
Personal Health OS is a mobile-first digital health platform designed to help individuals and families organize, track, and present their medical history through a conversational experience supported by AI. The product combines document storage, structured health tracking, reminders, symptom capture, timeline visualization, and doctor-ready reporting in one system.
The product is intentionally designed as a health record organization and communication platform, not as a diagnostic or treatment decision system. Its most important differentiator is the ability for a user to generate an AI-powered doctor report for any chosen date range and present it through a doctor-friendly web view or QR access during a consultation.
